  aifoundry3 (600 MHz, 522/698 mV) die   56 C: board  25.3 W = (a) 13.7 / 14 / 14.2 + (b) 8.44 / 9.12 / 10 + (c) 1.28 / 2.2 / 2.87 W; (c) is 5.1 / 8.7 / 11.4 %  [model]
  aifoundry3 (600 MHz, 522/698 mV) die   60 C: board  26.7 W = (a) 14 / 14.2 / 14.5 + (b) 9.55 / 10.3 / 11.2 + (c) 1.28 / 2.2 / 2.87 W; (c) is 4.8 / 8.2 / 10.8 %  [model]
